<path d="M30 420h580" stroke="#e5d8c4" stroke-width="2"/><g fill="#a1461e" font-size="20" font-weight="700"><text x="35" y="457">01</text><text x="35" y="542">02</text><text x="35" y="627">03</text><text x="35" y="712">04</text></g><g fill="#1b2b43"><text x="82" y="456" font-size="25" font-weight="700">Core</text><text x="82" y="483" font-size="20">Hydrogen nuclei fuse and release energy.</text><text x="82" y="541" font-size="25" font-weight="700">Radiative zone</text><text x="82" y="568" font-size="20">Energy moves outward through radiation.</text><text x="82" y="626" font-size="25" font-weight="700">Convection zone</text><text x="82" y="653" font-size="20">Moving hot material carries energy outward.</text><text x="82" y="711" font-size="25" font-weight="700">Visible surface / photosphere</text><text x="82" y="738" font-size="20">Light escapes into space from this layer.</text></g>
